<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts SGS-Thompson.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts SGS-Thompson.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franco-Italian microelectronics group SGS-Thompson was rated &quot;buy&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>CSFB analysts said the company should benefit from growth in key markets such as mobile phones, hard disk drives and smart cards -- expected to grow 33 percent a year through the next four or five years.</p>
<p>They expect SGS-Thompson's earnings per share to grow to $4.98 a share in 1998 from $3.05 in 1997.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
